  "question": {
    "text": "An ice-berg of density <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>900</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>kgm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math> is floating in water of density <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>kgm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The percentage of volume of ice-berg outside the water is&nbsp;"
